  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya, Madagascar. The purpose of the partnership is to implement best practices in e-waste management in Africa and to develop circular innovations based on the knowledge and expertise exchanged between The WEEE Centre and Vohitra Environment. The strengthened cooperation between the two organizations will expand their market reach and bring on board new partners in the modernization of their e-waste processing facilities in Kenya and Madagascar.</narrative>
  </description>
